{"id":"vn393x31yfohzub9tdig25nid","title":"转化食品废料为昆虫饲料仅带来低风险疯牛病传播","originalTitle":"Turning food waste into insect feed poses only low mad cow disease risk","summary":"研究人员评估了使用食品废料养虫的风险，发现即使在不利条件下，新疯牛病感染的风险也极低。研究基于三个废料来源和两种昆虫种类，结果显示在当前欧洲控制体系下风险很低。该研究为循环动物饲料生产提供了新见解，但仍需评估其他动物疾病风险。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Phys.org"},"links":{"original":"https://phys.org/news/2026-11-food-insect-poses-mad-cow.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T23:00:09.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-17T23:02:36.237Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-17T23:02:36.237Z","category":"clinical","tags":["研究成果"],"score":50,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"78265776-90bf-476b-9fdd-dbfe51f0a560","title":"食品废料昆虫饲料与疯牛病风险研究"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"78265776-90bf-476b-9fdd-dbfe51f0a560","title":"食品废料昆虫饲料与疯牛病风险研究"}],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fvYgiA8x7ZIE","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}